{"text":"kuruntokai","n":188,"lines":["முகைமுற் றினவே முல்லை முல்லையொடு","தகைமுற் றினவே தண்கார் வியன்புனம்","வாலிழை நெகிழ்த்தோர் வாரார்","மாலை வந்தன்றென் மாணலங் குறித்தே"],"tr":["mukaimuṟ ṟiṉavē mullai mullaiyoṭu","takaimuṟ ṟiṉavē taṇkār viyaṉpuṉam","vāliḻai nekiḻttōr vārār","mālai vantaṉṟeṉ māṇalaṅ kuṟittē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"mullai","tinai_ta":"முல்லை","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"மதுரை அளக்கர் ஞாழர் மகனார் மள்ளனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Maturai Aḷakkar Ñāḻar Makaṉār Maḷḷaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 13, vañcicīr 1, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 8, veṇṭaḷai 5, oṉṟiya vañcittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"முகைமுற்","tr":"mukaimuṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முகை","tr":"mukai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"முற்","tr":"muṟ"}]},{"text":"றினவே","tr":"ṟiṉavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"றின","tr":"ṟiṉa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]},{"text":"முல்லை","tr":"mullai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முல்","tr":"mul"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"முல்லையொடு","tr":"mullaiyoṭu","foot":"tēmāṅkaṉi","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முல்","tr":"mul"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யொடு","tr":"yoṭu"}]}],[{"text":"தகைமுற்","tr":"takaimuṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தகை","tr":"takai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"முற்","tr":"muṟ"}]},{"text":"றினவே","tr":"ṟiṉavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"றின","tr":"ṟiṉa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]},{"text":"தண்கார்","tr":"taṇkār","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தண்","tr":"taṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கார்","tr":"kār"}]},{"text":"வியன்புனம்","tr":"viyaṉpuṉam","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வியன்","tr":"viyaṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"புனம்","tr":"puṉam"}]}],[{"text":"வாலிழை","tr":"vāliḻai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லிழை","tr":"liḻai"}]},{"text":"நெகிழ்த்தோர்","tr":"nekiḻttōr","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நெகிழ்த்","tr":"nekiḻt"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோர்","tr":"tōr"}]},{"text":"வாரார்","tr":"vārār","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரார்","tr":"rār"}]}],[{"text":"மாலை","tr":"mālai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"வந்தன்றென்","tr":"vantaṉṟeṉ","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வந்","tr":"van"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றென்","tr":"ṟeṉ"}]},{"text":"மாணலங்","tr":"māṇalaṅ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணலங்","tr":"ṇalaṅ"}]},{"text":"குறித்தே","tr":"kuṟittē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குறித்","tr":"kuṟit"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"முகை","parts":[{"text":"முகை","lemma":"முகை","gloss":"bud"}],"gloss":"bud"},{"surface":"முற்றினவே","parts":[{"text":"முற்றின","lemma":"முற்று","gloss":"matured"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"have indeed matured"},{"surface":"முல்லை","parts":[{"text":"முல்லை","lemma":"முல்லை","gloss":"jasmine"}],"gloss":"jasmine"},{"surface":"முல்லையொடு","parts":[{"text":"முல்லை","lemma":"முல்லை","gloss":"jasmine"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"along with jasmine"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தகை","parts":[{"text":"தகை","lemma":"தகை","gloss":"beauty"}],"gloss":"beauty"},{"surface":"முற்றினவே","parts":[{"text":"முற்றின","lemma":"முற்று","gloss":"matured"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"has indeed reached fullness"},{"surface":"தண்கார்","parts":[{"text":"தண்","lemma":"தண்","gloss":"cool"},{"text":"கார்","lemma":"கார்","gloss":"rainy season"}],"gloss":"cool rainy season"},{"surface":"வியன்புனம்","parts":[{"text":"வியன்","lemma":"வியன்","gloss":"wide"},{"text":"புனம்","lemma":"புனம்","gloss":"forest field"}],"gloss":"wide forest field"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாலிழை","parts":[{"text":"வால்","lemma":"வால்","gloss":"bright"},{"text":"இழை","lemma":"இழை","gloss":"jewels"}],"gloss":"bright jewels"},{"surface":"நெகிழ்த்தோர்","parts":[{"text":"நெகிழ்","lemma":"நெகிழ்","gloss":"to become loose"},{"text":"த்து","lemma":"த்து","gloss":"causative"},{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"he who"}],"gloss":"he who caused them to slip"},{"surface":"வாரார்","parts":[{"text":"வாரார்","lemma":"வரு","gloss":"has not returned"}],"gloss":"has not returned"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"மாலை","gloss":"evening"}],"gloss":"evening"},{"surface":"வந்தன்று","parts":[{"text":"வந்தன்று","lemma":"வந்தன்று","gloss":"has arrived"}],"gloss":"has arrived","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"மாணலம்","parts":[{"text":"மாண்","lemma":"மாண்","gloss":"excellent"},{"text":"நலம்","lemma":"நலம்","gloss":"beauty"}],"gloss":"excellent beauty"},{"surface":"குறித்தே","parts":[{"text":"குறித்து","lemma":"குறி","gloss":"targeting"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"targeting indeed"}]}],"literal":"Buds have matured, the jasmine, along with jasmine / beauty has reached fullness in the cool rainy season's wide forest field / He who made my bright jewels slip has not returned / Evening has arrived, targeting my excellent beauty.","translation":"The jasmine buds have matured. Along with the jasmine, the wide forest fields of the cool rainy season have reached the fullness of their beauty. Yet, he who caused my bright ornaments to slip loose has not returned. And now, the evening has arrived, aiming to destroy my precious beauty.","modern":"முல்லை மொட்டுகள் மலரத் தொடங்கிவிட்டன. முல்லை மலர்களோடு குளிர்ந்த கார்காலத்தின் அகன்ற முல்லை நிலமும் தன் அழகில் முழுமை பெற்றுவிட்டது. என் ஒளிபொருந்திய அணிகலன்கள் நெகிழ்ந்து கழலும்படி செய்தவர் இன்னும் வரவில்லை. ஆனால், என் சிறந்த அழகை அழிப்பதை நோக்கமாகக் கொண்டு மாலைப் பொழுது வந்துவிட்டது.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her companion during the rainy season, which is the time her lover promised to return. She observes that the jasmine buds are blooming and the entire forest landscape is lush and beautiful with the arrival of the rains. However, her lover, whose absence causes her to waste away and makes her ornaments slip off, has not yet returned. Instead, the painful evening hour has arrived, which seems to specifically target and threaten her remaining vitality. This poem belongs to the mullai tiṇai, which is characterized by the theme of patient waiting during the rainy season.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}